    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594560/extras/5ffc22a35af94bc4f4e678273575d084.avif?t=1635192028\" /></div><br><br><strong>The Color-Switching Parkour Game</strong><br>In this game, you can experience 10 unique levels designed for original color-switching plus parkour gameplay. Switch between three colors: red, green, and blue as each one exposes a different version of the level. Wall jump, zipline, slide and climb between these three different versions of each level.<br><br>Chrome Switcher enables you to switch between three different colors while parkouring your way across the level, something never seen before for parkour games. Experience a retro-filled world with Synthwave music composed by <i>DGTV</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594560/extras/3be2c2b576741978bbef09b43d6d2b3a.poster.avif?t=1635192028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594560/extras/3be2c2b576741978bbef09b43d6d2b3a.webm?t=1635192028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594560/extras/3be2c2b576741978bbef09b43d6d2b3a.mp4?t=1635192028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging Levels:<br>Traverse through 10 levels each uniquely designed to give you a challenging parkour experience as you time your acrobatic skills between every color.<br><br></li><li> One Level, Three Versions:<br>Every level has three different versions: red, green, and blue. Each version shows different parkour objects you maneuver through.<br><br></li><li>Freedom of Movement: <br>Packed with an armory of acrobatic movement, fly across pits with wall-jumps, zipline across the void, wall-climb above a dangerous fall to your death, and more as you navigate through each level.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594560/extras/5ffc22a35af94bc4f4e678273575d084.avif?t=1635192028\" /></div><br><br><strong>The Color-Switching Parkour Game</strong><br>In this game, you can experience 10 unique levels designed for original color-switching plus parkour gameplay. Switch between three colors: red, green, and blue as each one exposes a different version of the level. Wall jump, zipline, slide and climb between these three different versions of each level.<br><br>Chrome Switcher enables you to switch between three different colors while parkouring your way across the level, something never seen before for parkour games. Experience a retro-filled world with Synthwave music composed by <i>DGTV</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594560/extras/3be2c2b576741978bbef09b43d6d2b3a.poster.avif?t=1635192028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594560/extras/3be2c2b576741978bbef09b43d6d2b3a.webm?t=1635192028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594560/extras/3be2c2b576741978bbef09b43d6d2b3a.mp4?t=1635192028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging Levels:<br>Traverse through 10 levels each uniquely designed to give you a challenging parkour experience as you time your acrobatic skills between every color.<br><br></li><li> One Level, Three Versions:<br>Every level has three different versions: red, green, and blue. Each version shows different parkour objects you maneuver through.<br><br></li><li>Freedom of Movement: <br>Packed with an armory of acrobatic movement, fly across pits with wall-jumps, zipline across the void, wall-climb above a dangerous fall to your death, and more as you navigate through each level.</li></ul>",
